    "Hourly prices are fetched from hvakosterstrommen.no (at most once an hour) and VAT is added. The electricity subsidy is deducted: the state covers 90 percent of the hourly price above 96.25 øre/kWh incl. VAT (2026)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Timeprisene hentes fra hvakosterstrommen.no (høyst én gang i timen) og tillegges mva. Strømstøtte trekkes fra: staten dekker 90 prosent av timeprisen over 96,25 øre/kWh inkl. mva (2026)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hourly prices are fetched from your Tibber account (at most once an hour). The token is stored in the keychain. The electricity subsidy is deducted: the state covers 90 percent of the hourly price above 96.25 øre/kWh incl. VAT (2026)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
